 "words_heard": 230,
 "words": 230,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I have made the LORD my refuge, the Most High my dwelling place",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the snare and through the sickness I am sheltered by his grace",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand fall beside me and ten thousand at my right",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But it will not come near me, for I'm hidden in his sight",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will cover you with his pinions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And under his wings you will find refuge",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His faithfulness is your shield and rampart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever dwells in the shelter of the Most High",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will rest in the shadow of the Almighty",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I won't fear the terror of the night or arrows in the day",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will command his angels to guard me in all my way",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will lift me in their hands so my foot won't strike a stone",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will tread upon the lion and the cobra, not alone",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will cover you with his pinions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And under his wings you will find refuge",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His faithfulness is your shield and rampart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever dwells in the shelter of the Most High",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will rest in the shadow of the Almighty",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because he clings to me in love, I will rescue him",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will call on me, and I will answer him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will be with him in trouble",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With long life I will satisfy him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I will show him my salvation",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
